[node name="BombBoo" type="Node3D" groups=["sms_bomb_boo"]]
script = ExtResource("1_script")
metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 158 / 159: a BOMB BOO (KINGBOO_REMATCH_gdoc.txt) -- Galaxy's black Boo, Mario's weapon in the rematch. The supply (SmsBombBooSpawner in RematchArena.tscn) makes them out of black foggy spots; one drifts toward Mario and hovers; his SPIN (X, no FLUDD) within reach grabs it BY THE TONGUE: he holds the tongue up in one hand and the Boo SWINGS ROUND HIM on it (OrbitRadius, OrbitDegPerSec; a spin jump speeds it); a dive drops it; walk it into King Boo and it bursts on him -- a hit. It is not thrown. Knobs: Look (ModelScale, Opacity 1 = solid, Lift, FaceGlow, Glow, TongueOffset, FacesPlusZ), Drift (DriftSpeed, DriftStopDistance, HoverHeight, the bob, ExpireSeconds), The swing (OrbitRadius, OrbitOverHand, OrbitDegPerSec, OrbitLeanDeg, SpinJumpBoost, HoldSeconds 0 = never bursts in hand), the sounds. Mario's side (the reach, the arm) is on his inspector under SMS Rematch; King Boo's body cylinder (HitRadius...) on KingBoo."

